  "story": {
    "day": 39,
    "title": "Saturday Lunch",
    "sentences": [
      "Last Saturday, Kaya made soup with her mother.",
      "They used a great recipe from her classmate.",
      "They ate the sweet and sour soup with soft bread.",
      "\"Is it okay?\" Kaya asked.",
      "Her father, an office worker, smiled at her.",
      "Next, he showed a picture on his phone.",
      "\"She's my friend from Finland,\" he said.",
      "She teaches English, math, and science in China.",
      "He's going to meet her in Hong Kong.",
      "His big trip is in August, not February.",
      "After lunch, Kaya put on a purple hat.",
      "Then, she rode her bike to the movie theater."
    ]
  }
}